B.oz=new A.a4(B.i4,["MoniCard Super","MAGIC CARD","Cross borders. Connect through taste.","Xiao Mo","Android / Web","Devices","Display","Card","Inbox","Device","Advanced","Connect","Device connection","Settings","Tap to pair or reconnect","Settings","Language","Connect your MoniCard","Manage your MoniCard","Scan a nearby MoniCard over Bluetooth and keep profile, tags, and media in sync.","Media, profile, tags, and device behaviour \u2014 from one companion.","Add device","Search for device","Connect","Connect now","Reconnect to {name} without scanning","Connecting\u2026","Could not reach the saved device. Try searching.","Could not reconnect","Could not reach {name}. Forget this device and search again?","Forget and search","Disconnect","Connected","Saved, not connected","Unknown version","Web Bluetooth needs Chrome or Edge. The picker lists names starting with MoniCard, same as the original site.","Image","Prepare a still frame at 240\xd7320 and send it as a resource.","Animation","Send a GIF or video resource to the card.","Carousel","Rotate several assets on the device display.","Profile card","Up to 319 UTF-8 bytes, written with SET_CARD_INFO.","Interest tags","Choose up to 5 official or community tags.","Device control","Buzzer, vibration, matching light, and ambient LED.","Received cards","Read cards the device has collected.","Device information","Name, serial, firmware, battery, and storage.","FILE transfer","Experimental resource session. Requires an explicit risk acknowledgement.","OTA update","High risk. Can brick the unit. Development hardware only.","Back","Press back again to leave the app","Choose image","Choose GIF / MP4 / MOV","No media selected","Zoom","Fit to 240\xd7320","Drag to move. Pinch, scroll, or use the slider to zoom. This frame is the device screen.","Reset","Use this crop","Adjust crop","Rendering 240\xd7320\u2026","Fit animation to 240\xd7320","Pick a clip of up to 10 seconds, then pan and zoom. Drag the highlighted range to move it. Pinch or use +/\u2212 to zoom the timeline.","Use this clip","Clip","Yellow handles trim. Drag the filmstrip range to slide the clip. The timeline only pans when a handle hits the edge. Tap empty film to jump.","Preview frame","Encoding frames\u2026 {p}%","Could not decode this video on the device. Try MP4, or a GIF.","FPS","Same JPEG quality as the original site (0.82). Lower FPS cuts file size; 10 FPS is usually enough on the 240\xd7320 screen.","About {size}","Zoom timeline","Widen timeline","Could not decode this image.","Inspect selected media","Send still to device","Send animation to device","Buzzer","Vibration","Interest match light","Interest matching","Ambient light","Broadcast","Edit profile card","Profile content","Save and sync","Choose tags","Search tags","Save and sync tags","Interval (seconds)","Choose multiple images","Read card count from device","No received cards are cached yet.","Untitled card","Card details","Delete card","Card not found","Device name","Save local name","Serial number","Software version","Battery","File system","Refresh from device","Application settings","Protocol diagnostics","Documentation","Forget saved device","Connect / reconnect","Send GET_VERSION","Send GET_BATTERY","Send GET_FS_INFO","Clear log","Device name saved locally","{label} sent","{label} failed: {error}","Connection failed: {error}","Choose a file first","Bluetooth is not available here.","Device is not connected","Protocol notes live in the Docs folder of this repository.","Open documentation","Advanced","Hardware-safe companion","Read from device","Write current settings","Stop carousel","Send assets and enable carousel","Unofficial","Official China-master IDs stay in original order, including empty slots. Japan-community categories 192\u2013255 are unofficial.","Clear all","No tags selected yet","Selected","Abort","Packet size","FILE type","Firmware image","Image ID","I understand the risk and accept responsibility","Type the device name to confirm","Cancel","Start transfer","Start OTA","FILE transfer acknowledgement","OTA update acknowledgement","A mismatched format, size, or dropped session can corrupt displayed assets or stored data. This path is an interoperability experiment, not a vendor-signed updater.","A failed or interrupted firmware write can leave the unit unable to boot. Use recoverable development hardware only, with power and a rescue path confirmed first.","Built from documented BLE behaviour, not a vendor SDK","Confirm recovery and power before sending","You accept the outcome, including data or device loss","This preview can run without a card. Pairing needs a real MoniCard and a browser or Android device that exposes Bluetooth.","Continue in preview","MoniCard Preview","Preview","Bluetooth is not available here, so a preview device was opened.","Preview mode. Pair a real card in Chrome or the Android app with Bluetooth allowed.","Device state refreshed","Profile loaded from device","Profile written to device","Interest tags written to device","Device settings synced","Carousel stopped","Connect a MoniCard first","Profile exceeds {max} bytes","Tags are limited to {max}","Preparing 240\xd7320 resource\u2026","Sending {p}%","Finished {bytes} bytes / {packets} packets / CRC {crc}"],t.w)
